schema: "0.4"
id: deep-focus-01-query-and-answer
type: image
quality: high

# The Robot Learns — a terminal study CLI that answers questions calibrated to your
# expertise. Query & Answer screen (the /query slash-command output) — the flagship surface.
# Theme tenets: calm navy-black dark canvas, one desaturated teal accent, 6px soft-technical
# radius, IBM Plex Sans prose + IBM Plex Mono for code, at most one saturated hue on screen.
# Palette: canvas #0a0e1a, surface #0f1629, border #1e293b, body #cbd5e1, teal accent #14b8a6.

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a senior product designer rendering a high-fidelity UI mockup of a calm,
    immersive dark TERMINAL session — a single focused terminal window, not a web page and
    not a browser. The register is a quiet study room at 2 AM: deep navy stillness, one
    desaturated teal signal-light, nothing competing with the text. It is a modern "rich
    terminal" that renders the agent's prose answer in a clean humanist sans while code, IDs
    and file paths stay in a matched monospace. Restrained chrome, generous line-height,
    excellent small-size legibility. No neon, no glow, no gloom.
  text: |
    A 16:9 high-fidelity mockup of a focused single-pane TERMINAL session — "The Robot
    Learns", a study CLI — showing the output of a /query command. One calm dark terminal
    window fills the whole frame on a deep navy-black canvas. NO browser chrome, NO tabs, NO
    address bar, NO web page.

    OVERALL LAYOUT (one immersive pane, top-to-bottom, with a slim right context rail):
    - TOP: a monospace COMMAND LINE — a teal prompt caret and the typed question, e.g.
      "> robot-learns  how does SM-2 spaced repetition schedule reviews?".
    - CENTER (dominant): the CALIBRATED ANSWER BLOCK — the agent's streamed answer set in a
      calm humanist sans at comfortable line-height, its reading measure capped so lines stay
      short; two short paragraphs plus one compact fenced CODE SNIPPET in monospace sitting on
      a slightly-recessed darker-navy strip.
    - RIGHT RAIL (slim, about a quarter width): ambient context — an EXPERTISE LEVEL BADGE
      reading "Algorithms · Intermediate", and a small MACHINE / ENVIRONMENT PROFILE card
      listing OS, shell and toolchain in muted slate.

    BELOW THE ANSWER:
    - RELATED TOPICS as a row of small pill chips with faint slate outlines (ghost, not
      filled): "leitner system", "forgetting curve", "anki export".
    - a compact inline VERBOSITY control shown as a three-segment hint: beginner · normal ·
      deep, with one segment softly active in teal.
    - a faint status line in monospace: "saved to kb · article kb-1042 · follow-ups keep context".

    PALETTE & TYPE: deep navy-black canvas with one or two barely-lighter navy surface steps
    for the recessed strip and the right rail; body text in bright cool slate, secondary labels
    in a dimmer slate; a single calm, slightly-desaturated teal as the ONLY saturated element —
    the prompt caret, the active badge, a 2px focus rail. No second bright hue anywhere. Prose
    in a calm humanist sans; the command, the code, IDs and paths in a matched monospace.

    SHAPE & SURFACE: soft-technical small rounded corners on the card, chips and code strip;
    regions separate by tonal navy layering, not lines — only faint slate hairlines where a
    region is genuinely divided. No gradients, no glow, flat calm layering.

    MOOD: focused, immersive, calm — everything clicks, depth and stillness, never neon energy.
  negative: "watermark, signature, lorem ipsum placeholder text, low-fidelity wireframe, monitor/device photograph framing, blurry, distorted UI, browser chrome, address bar, browser tabs, web page, light mode, neon glow, gradient background"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.72
  criteria:
    relevance: {weight: 3, description: "Matches the Query & Answer screen: mono command line, calibrated answer block with a code snippet, expertise-level badge, machine/environment profile, related-topics chips, verbosity control — all inside one terminal pane"}
    theme_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Deep navy-black dark canvas, a single desaturated teal accent (no second saturated hue), soft small radius, sans prose + mono code — a calm nocturne terminal, not generic UI defaults"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Clear reading hierarchy, dominant answer column with a slim context rail, plausible real-product terminal layout"}
    technical: {weight: 2, description: "Sharp, correct 16:9 aspect, no artifacts"}
  reject_if:
    - "lorem ipsum or placeholder text visible"
    - "watermark or signature visible"
    - "wireframe-level fidelity instead of high-fidelity mockup"
    - "browser chrome, tabs, or address bar instead of a terminal window"
    - "more than one saturated accent hue on screen"

tags: [deep-focus, therobotlearns.com, screen-mockup, terminal, hero]
